      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i like the first one. actually, i'm worried about people in the comments saying stuff about how \"traditional\" is outdated or that it's not the only way to raise kids. can u give me some quick talking points i can use to explain why the traditional model is actually more scientifically grounded for kids? something that sounds authoritative but not rude.",
